Policy on the Withholding, Seizing and Freezing Funds related to
Terrorists or the Financing of Terrorism
The Lao PDR shall implement measures to withhold, seizure or freeze the funds
associated to terrorism and terrorist financing in accordance with the following principles:
1. Ensure consistency with relevant national policies, laws, regulations, and international
obligations;
2. Protect national stability and security;
3. Guarantee the protection of the rights and legitimate interests of natural persons, legal
persons, and organizations;
4. Ensure procedures are prompt, clear, transparent, fair, and verifiable.
